Installed-Size: 11
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/cornball-ai/pkgexec
Description: privileged apt effector for the Runix mutation boundary (scaffold)
 pkgexec is the privileged apt effector for Runix: per-verb libapt-pkg binaries
 that commit apt package transactions under pkexec/polkit and a broker-issued
 effect receipt.
 .
 This is the slice-1 scaffold and is deliberately incapable of mutation. It
 carries the schema-1 plan-digest encoder (OpenSSL EVP), the strict stdin
 request parser, and process-hygiene primitives, all tested; it ships no
 mutation-capable entrypoint, no polkit policy, and takes no lock.
